DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42202::$$$message_0330_0000_0000$$$::"...The invitation said it should be somewhere around here... Don't tell me..."::
42203::$$$message_0330_0000_0001$$$::"Heh heh heh! Well met, maid duo! I can see that old Jubstacheit's seal worked like a charm!"::
42204::$$$message_0330_0000_0002$$$::"Ahaha! I dunno what that means, but I'm laughing from my high horse too, hahaha!"::
42205::$$$message_0330_0000_0003$$$::"A-are you...!?[br]::
42206::$$$message_0330_0000_0004$$$::The...spitting image of Lady Illyasviel, but something is...off."::
42207::$$$message_0330_0000_0005$$$::"Huh? This is harder than a spot-the-difference quiz.[lr]::
42208::$$$message_0330_0000_0006$$$::That Illya looks just like Illya."::
42209::$$$message_0330_0000_0007$$$::"It's the gym shorts. The gym shorts are way different."::
42210::$$$message_0330_0000_0008$$$::"Hey, shut up, Taiga!"::
42211::$$$message_0330_0000_0009$$$::"Anyway, it's good you two came.[lr]::
42212::$$$message_0330_0000_0010$$$::Did you like my invitation?"::
42213::$$$message_0330_0000_0011$$$::"Wha... [wait canskip=0 time=400][l][say storage=HMED6_SER_0040 _name=セラ]So you invited us here? What are you scheming!?[lr]::
42214::$$$message_0330_0000_0012$$$::Was the onsen offer all a lie!?"::
42215::$$$message_0330_0000_0013$$$::"Scheming? I asked you here to serve me. I'm going to the onsen, and I can hardly get by on my own."::
42216::$$$message_0330_0000_0014$$$::"Huh?[lr]::
42217::$$$message_0330_0000_0015$$$::What do you mean, 'on your own'?"::
42218::$$$message_0330_0000_0016$$$::"Oh, you know. I'd just feel better if we had some help.[lr]::
42219::$$$message_0330_0000_0017$$$::Zella, Liv. Behave yourselves and follow me. We really are going to the onsen resort."::
42220::$$$message_0330_0000_0018$$$::"But the reservation's only for two! Kekeke, looks like only the survivors will get to go!"::
42221::$$$message_0330_0000_0019$$$::"W-wait, what!? What the heck, Taiga! You said you put all four of us on the reservation!"::
42222::$$$message_0330_0000_0020$$$::"Well, about that..."::
42223::$$$message_0330_0001_0000$$$::"I read the room and changed the reservation, like 'I bet Illya would accidentally say four when she actually meant two, the little devil.'"::
42224::$$$message_0330_0001_0001$$$::"Just die![lr]::
42225::$$$message_0330_0001_0002$$$::Please die and be reborn as someone who knows how to be considerate in a sane way!"::
42226::$$$message_0330_0001_0003$$$::"...A-anyway.[lr]::
42227::$$$message_0330_0001_0004$$$::It seems we have to defeat you to reach the onsen."::
42228::$$$message_0330_0001_0005$$$::"You would raise a hand against your mistress, Zella!?"::
42229::$$$message_0330_0001_0006$$$::"It would normally be unimaginable, but you do not appear to be our Illyasviel."::
42230::$$$message_0330_0002_0000$$$::"Also, 'Zella,' really?"::
42231::$$$message_0330_0002_0001$$$::"I like that Illya. But. Gotta spank her a little. For the onsen."::
42232::$$$message_0330_0002_0002$$$::"That's what makes you a model maid! Evil never prospers!"::

